WEBVTT

00:23.480 --> 00:25.920
[spray can hissing]

00:28.880 --> 00:31.480
[hissing continues]

00:39.600 --> 00:40.520
[spotlight clicks]

00:42.320 --> 00:46.280
[Nanno] Light… will always shine
on the geniuses

00:48.960 --> 00:51.280
or the ones who are more special
than others.

00:55.680 --> 00:58.320
It will never shine on the losers.

01:05.760 --> 01:08.960
[classical music]

01:15.200 --> 01:19.040
[Nanno] Our world only has space
for the geniuses.

01:19.120 --> 01:20.720
What about the ordinary ones?

01:21.320 --> 01:22.280
How will they live?

01:28.960 --> 01:32.360
[sobbing]

01:32.440 --> 01:34.960
[classical music intensifies]

01:37.040 --> 01:39.480
[announcer] The first place award
for Most Outstanding School

01:39.560 --> 01:41.600
goes to Lerdvithi School.

01:42.080 --> 01:44.240
I would like to invite the principal
to give a speech.

01:46.120 --> 01:49.400
[applause]

01:49.480 --> 01:53.160
It's not easy to come up and speak
about the same thing once again,

01:53.640 --> 01:56.640
unless it's about the pride
of Lerdvithi School.

01:57.360 --> 01:58.680
It's been eight years.

01:59.160 --> 02:00.400
Eight years.

02:01.320 --> 02:03.800
I'm not up here because of the effort

02:03.880 --> 02:06.240
of a particular teacher or a student,

02:06.720 --> 02:10.080
but every single one of us
who refuses to believe

02:10.160 --> 02:13.560
that humans have any kind of limitations.

02:13.640 --> 02:15.720
We can go further than ever before.

02:15.800 --> 02:17.320
We can do much better.

02:17.400 --> 02:20.080
The word "limitation" does not exist.

02:20.160 --> 02:22.960
[swirling]

02:24.920 --> 02:27.360
[principal] And when all of us believe
in the same thing…

02:27.440 --> 02:28.520
[smacks]

02:28.600 --> 02:31.560
-all goals can be achieved.
-Well, you took long enough.

02:31.640 --> 02:32.680
What's up, girl?

02:32.760 --> 02:35.560
-[principal] And this award is a proof of…
-[Mew] I was pooping.

02:35.640 --> 02:37.120
I feel much lighter now.

02:37.200 --> 02:39.040
-Um…
-The pride of Lerdvithi--

02:39.120 --> 02:41.640
…you could each take home a trophy today.

02:41.720 --> 02:44.000
His speech is longer than usual.

02:44.080 --> 02:47.720
Oh, don't complain. Whenever
we don't have class, it's all good.

02:47.800 --> 02:49.080
I haven't washed my hands yet.

02:49.600 --> 02:51.880
Oh, my god! That was so gross.

02:51.960 --> 02:54.760
Have you never heard
of personal hygiene or what?

02:54.840 --> 02:57.120
Finally, I would like to share with you

02:57.200 --> 02:59.920
the humble motto of our Lerdvithi School.

03:00.440 --> 03:04.000
"Even in darkness,
real diamonds will shine."

03:04.080 --> 03:05.480
Thank you, all.

03:06.960 --> 03:10.200
[applause]

03:10.280 --> 03:11.760
[bell tolls]

03:13.120 --> 03:15.120
[theme music]

04:24.480 --> 04:27.480
[soft piano music]

04:39.600 --> 04:42.200
[Pui] Why do you always bring me here
when we go for a walk?

04:42.280 --> 04:44.880
Coming here won't get your name
inscribed on the pole

04:44.960 --> 04:46.800
or get your hands imprinted.

04:47.360 --> 04:50.800
This is why your name
will never be on the pole.

04:51.320 --> 04:53.640
You don't care
about anything enough to try.

04:53.720 --> 04:56.520
Your name won't be on this pole,
or that pole, and never will be.

04:56.600 --> 05:00.880
Why must you always try
to insult me, like this?

05:00.960 --> 05:01.840
Okay.

05:02.320 --> 05:05.280
Well… I guess…

05:06.600 --> 05:07.840
I feel…

05:10.520 --> 05:13.760
a little jealous. They're good at things.

05:14.600 --> 05:16.360
I just feel like such a loser.

05:16.960 --> 05:19.120
Did someone say something
to upset you again?

05:25.480 --> 05:28.800
Mew, can you put down your phone
and eat first?

05:29.720 --> 05:30.880
Huh?

05:30.960 --> 05:32.160
Just a sec.

05:33.240 --> 05:34.720
You are always on that thing.

05:34.800 --> 05:36.280
This is why your grades dropped.

05:37.080 --> 05:39.720
Why can't you be more
like your sister, Pang, huh?

05:39.800 --> 05:41.920
[Mew] I have a 3.5 GPA.

05:42.000 --> 05:43.880
And I've won a silver medal.

05:44.720 --> 05:48.200
[Pui] But they have a 4.0 GPA
and gold medals.

05:50.040 --> 05:52.600
But you don't have to feel bad
because you still have me,

05:52.680 --> 05:54.840
who has a 3.3 GPA

05:54.920 --> 05:57.440
and a bronze medal.
Isn't that right, yeah?

05:58.840 --> 06:00.120
Right.

06:02.600 --> 06:04.480
[Plearn] You both like to throw
a pity party.

06:05.720 --> 06:08.080
That's why neither of you will ever excel.

06:09.160 --> 06:12.960
[Plearn] In the future,
you will both become burdens to society.

06:13.520 --> 06:15.440
Didn't you listen to the principal today?

06:15.920 --> 06:17.640
He always says without limits.

06:18.120 --> 06:19.720
You spiral out of control.

06:21.560 --> 06:24.480
Hey, Nanno.
Can you come here for a second?

06:24.560 --> 06:25.600
[Nanno] Sure.

06:30.880 --> 06:32.080
[Plearn] Look at Nanno.

06:32.600 --> 06:34.480
She arrived only two weeks ago,

06:34.560 --> 06:37.560
but she has already discovered
her special abilities.

06:39.600 --> 06:44.120
Nanno, dear, can you help them
find their own special skills?

06:44.200 --> 06:46.320
We don't want the two of them becoming…

06:48.080 --> 06:50.520
parasites that are gonna pull
our school down.

06:50.600 --> 06:52.000
Heaven forbid.

06:53.600 --> 06:54.640
Of course.

06:56.200 --> 06:57.720
Let's go have lunch, dear.

06:57.800 --> 07:01.080
I've prepared some special dishes
for the new genius at our school.

07:01.600 --> 07:02.960
-Let's go.
-Okay.

07:06.920 --> 07:08.160
[Pui] Okay, bye.

07:08.240 --> 07:09.440
[Mew] "Let's go have lunch."

07:09.520 --> 07:12.800
"I've prepared some special dishes
for the new genius at school."

07:12.880 --> 07:15.120
-Sounds fun.
-Why did she call her that?

07:15.200 --> 07:16.200
Look.

07:17.800 --> 07:19.120
[Pui] "Quantum physics."

07:19.200 --> 07:20.880
"Buddhism."

07:20.960 --> 07:22.000
[Pui chuckles]

07:23.200 --> 07:25.800
Physics and Buddhism?

07:27.560 --> 07:28.720
Really?

07:28.800 --> 07:29.920
[Pui chuckles]

07:33.680 --> 07:36.960
[dreamy music]

07:47.160 --> 07:49.120
[indistinct school chatter]

07:54.360 --> 07:55.680
[class representative] Attention.

07:56.640 --> 07:58.560
-[students] Hello.
-[female student] Good morning.

07:58.640 --> 08:00.360
[Plearn] Hello, students.

08:00.440 --> 08:02.440
I have good news for you all.

08:02.520 --> 08:05.880
Last week, we announced a genius
named Nanno.

08:06.400 --> 08:08.320
Today, we have a new genius.

08:09.960 --> 08:14.200
This person just won the first prize
from the Thai Literature Association

08:14.280 --> 08:16.600
that was announced last night.

08:17.640 --> 08:19.520
That person is Pui.

08:21.560 --> 08:24.480
[students applauding]

08:28.000 --> 08:30.240
[Plearn] Pui, why don't you share
something with the class?

08:30.320 --> 08:31.240
[Pui] Sure.

08:31.920 --> 08:34.039
This is the first time I won.

08:34.520 --> 08:36.080
I'm actually very proud.

08:36.640 --> 08:39.200
Everyone has their own special skills.

08:39.280 --> 08:42.799
Believe in all of your potential
and strive to work hard.

08:43.280 --> 08:46.800
Go beyond your limitations
and you can become successful like us.

08:47.280 --> 08:48.280
Thank you, all.

08:51.840 --> 08:54.600
[Plearn] Pui, thank you so much
for listening to my advice

08:54.680 --> 08:57.360
and taking the action to improve yourself.

09:02.400 --> 09:03.240
[Nanno] Hey, Pui.

09:04.760 --> 09:07.320
I'll add you to the group chat
of the geniuses, okay?

09:07.920 --> 09:08.960
[Pui] Okay.

09:11.440 --> 09:13.520
[dramatic music]

09:16.520 --> 09:18.320
[Plearn] Congratulations, Pui.

09:18.400 --> 09:21.600
You finally discovered
the genius that lies within you.

09:24.920 --> 09:26.280
[Pui] Thank you very much, ma'am.

09:28.160 --> 09:29.760
[Plearn] Let's go have lunch, okay.

09:29.840 --> 09:30.920
[Pui] I'd like that.

09:45.320 --> 09:47.400
MS. PIYARAT SAELIM

09:47.480 --> 09:49.640
1ST PLACE, THAI LITERATURE ASSOCIATION

09:53.800 --> 09:56.680
[foreboding music]

10:19.840 --> 10:21.320
[bell tolls]

10:37.520 --> 10:39.120
[Nanno] Why are your hands dirty, Mew?

10:47.040 --> 10:48.520
I've done it before, you know.

10:51.400 --> 10:52.480
What's that?

10:53.600 --> 10:55.760
Put my fingers
on someone else's hand print.

10:56.280 --> 10:58.120
I did it on my first day here.

11:01.720 --> 11:04.080
Hey. Don't you think it's weird that

11:04.560 --> 11:07.040
Pui can suddenly write
a good novel within a week?

11:12.840 --> 11:14.480
Do you want to know the secret, Mew?

11:17.120 --> 11:18.280
What secret?

11:18.760 --> 11:20.000
For something like this,

11:20.080 --> 11:22.000
if you want to know, you have to…

11:22.640 --> 11:23.920
Nanno, come on.

11:24.400 --> 11:25.720
Okay, I'll tell you.

11:27.440 --> 11:29.440
If you want to become a genius like me,

11:30.160 --> 11:31.800
all you have to do is go to Google,

11:33.000 --> 11:34.440
press Control-C

11:35.400 --> 11:36.440
and Control-V.

11:37.880 --> 11:39.040
And that's it.

11:40.880 --> 11:41.960
Wait.

11:42.640 --> 11:46.080
Are you trying to say that Pui
was able to write a novel

11:46.600 --> 11:48.120
because she copied it from Google?

11:48.200 --> 11:49.840
It's harsh to say she copied it.

11:49.920 --> 11:53.720
If you would ask Pui, she would tell you
that she was really inspired.

11:54.200 --> 11:56.200
[Nanno] Inspired by what she found
on Google

11:56.280 --> 11:58.160
with some key modifications

11:58.720 --> 11:59.920
thrown in here and there.

12:01.320 --> 12:06.440
Well then, you are a Physics genius
because you…

12:07.000 --> 12:09.800
Hey. Look at the cheerleaders over there.

12:09.880 --> 12:12.280
Do you think they came up
with their own moves?

12:12.360 --> 12:14.360
What about all the movie
and TV show remakes?

12:14.440 --> 12:15.280
[clapperboard clicks]

12:15.360 --> 12:16.840
As for musical notes…

12:17.840 --> 12:19.080
there are only seven of them.

12:19.160 --> 12:21.160
♪ Hallelujah! ♪

12:21.240 --> 12:25.520
They just keep recycling them
many times over and over, and over again.

12:29.800 --> 12:30.880
Hey.

12:31.480 --> 12:33.200
As for Plearn's art assignment,

12:33.280 --> 12:34.840
why don't you give it a try?

12:38.680 --> 12:40.200
And what if I get caught?

12:40.920 --> 12:43.120
No one has ever caught me and Pui,
did they?

12:45.120 --> 12:46.600
If you do get caught,

12:47.120 --> 12:48.880
you just won't be called a genius.

12:59.320 --> 13:00.400
[keyboard clacking]

13:00.480 --> 13:01.480
SEARCH

13:04.560 --> 13:06.840
[somber music]

13:06.920 --> 13:09.600
[keyboard clacking]

13:10.160 --> 13:11.560
[somber music]

13:22.480 --> 13:23.600
[clicking]

13:23.680 --> 13:26.680
[machine whirring]

13:26.760 --> 13:29.680
[somber music]

13:40.880 --> 13:42.880
[somber music continues]

13:56.800 --> 13:57.960
[Mew grunts]

14:00.240 --> 14:01.160
[smirks]

14:05.320 --> 14:06.880
[Mew grunting]

14:10.600 --> 14:12.880
[classical fanfare music]

14:12.960 --> 14:14.240
[laughs]

14:20.080 --> 14:21.200
[chuckles]

14:21.960 --> 14:25.000
[classical fanfare music]

14:26.440 --> 14:27.800
[chuckles]

14:27.880 --> 14:30.920
[classical fanfare music intensifies]

14:35.400 --> 14:36.400
[camera clicks]

14:38.320 --> 14:39.640
[clicking continues]

14:50.080 --> 14:50.920
[Nanno] Here.

15:01.560 --> 15:02.640
[Mew] Nanno.

15:02.720 --> 15:05.480
[Nanno] Wow! It's very beautiful, Mew.

15:05.560 --> 15:08.520
Hey, you can print and sell this.

15:09.120 --> 15:10.720
Doesn't your family own a printing shop?

15:15.160 --> 15:17.400
Mew, you haven't finished
your artwork yet?

15:17.480 --> 15:18.680
[Nanno] She finished it.

15:18.760 --> 15:20.200
It's very beautiful.

15:22.600 --> 15:24.240
[Plearn] If you're done, then bring it up.

15:25.040 --> 15:27.000
Well, um…

15:27.600 --> 15:30.280
Your friend calls it beautiful,
so I want to see it now.

15:30.360 --> 15:31.440
Don't be shy.

15:36.120 --> 15:38.880
[tense music]

15:53.520 --> 15:56.120
-[Mew] I don't think…
-[Plearn] Let me see it.

15:56.200 --> 15:57.960
Come on. Now hand it over.

16:12.120 --> 16:14.520
Please tell me that you did this yourself.

16:20.000 --> 16:22.480
-Well…
-[Plearn] It's very good.

16:24.240 --> 16:28.040
Remarkable, you must enter your work
into the Siam Arts Competition.

16:30.160 --> 16:31.520
Look at this, class.

16:32.080 --> 16:35.720
I will submit this to represent our school
in the competition.

16:35.800 --> 16:37.120
I believe in you.

16:37.600 --> 16:40.320
I hope your peers can all learn
from you as well.

16:41.680 --> 16:42.880
[Nanno] That's awesome, Mew.

16:42.960 --> 16:46.920
[applauding]

16:51.440 --> 16:54.440
[dreamy music]

16:57.040 --> 17:03.080
THE FIRST STEP TO SUCCESS.
THANK YOU FOR THE PRIZE, SIAM ARTS.

17:05.800 --> 17:08.160
MISS NICHANART SITTHIBAWORNCHOT
YOUTH WINNER OF SIAM ARTS

17:11.119 --> 17:12.119
[Plearn] Mew.

17:13.520 --> 17:16.560
I'm very happy
that our school can finally boast

17:16.640 --> 17:18.280
of having an art genius.

17:19.720 --> 17:21.560
We have one for sports,

17:21.640 --> 17:23.319
a few for academics,

17:23.400 --> 17:24.880
and some for music.

17:25.800 --> 17:27.119
But never for art.

17:27.599 --> 17:30.600
You really helped the school
overcome our shortcoming.

17:35.000 --> 17:36.680
And I'm happy to do that.

17:39.520 --> 17:41.440
Let's go have some lunch now, shall we?

17:42.200 --> 17:43.200
Yeah.

17:43.840 --> 17:45.200
[chuckling]

17:45.760 --> 17:46.760
Hmm…

17:58.760 --> 17:59.920
Mew.

18:00.480 --> 18:01.680
[Pui] Congratulations.

18:09.040 --> 18:10.920
You're not still mad at me, are you?

18:17.680 --> 18:18.720
Hmm.

18:19.400 --> 18:23.000
Since we're both considered
geniuses of our school now,

18:23.480 --> 18:25.720
why don't we go back
to being friends like we were?

18:27.680 --> 18:28.560
Hm…

18:29.120 --> 18:31.440
A genius who copied other people's work?

18:33.720 --> 18:34.880
I'm sorry.

18:35.360 --> 18:37.200
I don't think I can do that.

18:39.000 --> 18:40.080
Mew.

18:44.360 --> 18:45.320
Mew!

18:47.160 --> 18:50.160
[classical music]

18:53.760 --> 18:56.320
EVERYONE, I ADDED MEW TO THE GROUP.

18:56.400 --> 18:57.760
HELLO, MEW.

18:57.840 --> 19:00.520
HELLO.

19:00.600 --> 19:02.120
HELLO, EVERYONE.

19:02.200 --> 19:04.560
MISS PLEARN BOUGHT ME A MEAL.

19:08.440 --> 19:09.800
SHE TREATED YOU BETTER THAN ME.

19:09.880 --> 19:11.560
YOU HAVE A LOT OF FOLLOWERS
ON SOCIAL MEDIA.

19:11.640 --> 19:13.880
IF I WERE AS GOOD AS YOU,
I WOULDN'T HAVE KEPT IT A SECRET.

19:13.960 --> 19:16.080
YOU MUST HAVE BEEN PRACTICING, RIGHT?

19:16.160 --> 19:18.520
YEAH.

19:18.600 --> 19:20.240
YOUR NEXT PAINTING MUST BE AWESOME.

19:20.320 --> 19:21.800
THAT'S FOR SURE.

19:21.880 --> 19:25.440
I WANT TO SEE THE NEXT ONE ALREADY.

19:25.520 --> 19:27.600
[foreboding music]

19:27.680 --> 19:31.080
IT TAKES TIME.

19:31.160 --> 19:35.160
JUST A DRAFT IS FINE.
I WANT TO SEE IT TONIGHT.

20:02.800 --> 20:04.800
[ominous music]

20:04.880 --> 20:05.800
[door opens]

20:06.280 --> 20:08.080
Mom, why don't you knock?

20:10.480 --> 20:13.280
[Mew's mom] I just brought you
some soy milk. Here you go.

20:14.480 --> 20:15.600
Drink it up.

20:18.720 --> 20:21.000
Hmm…
[chuckles]

20:21.560 --> 20:23.760
Hey. You know what, huh?

20:23.840 --> 20:27.080
Ever since you won that award
your father would not stop praising you.

20:27.160 --> 20:29.280
Mew, do you hear what I'm telling you?

20:29.360 --> 20:33.400
He is singing you praises, honey.
He brags about you to everyone.

20:34.400 --> 20:38.520
Yeah, that's all he does every day.
We always knew you were talented.

20:38.600 --> 20:39.920
[giggles]

20:43.080 --> 20:43.920
[smooching]

20:44.000 --> 20:45.160
-Stop it.
- I'm leaving.

20:46.160 --> 20:48.400
-What was that for?
-[Mew's mom] Finish the soy milk.

20:48.480 --> 20:49.560
[Mew] Get out.

20:59.440 --> 21:00.480
[sighs]

21:09.200 --> 21:10.840
[keyboard clacking]

21:12.680 --> 21:15.640
[somber music]

21:25.600 --> 21:29.760
WE BECOME SUCCESSFUL WHEN WE DO
THINGS WE THOUGHT WE COULDN'T.

21:30.360 --> 21:33.720
INSPIRATION COMES FROM
WITHIN OURSELVES.

21:33.800 --> 21:38.800
NEVER BELIEVE THAT HUMANS HAVE LIMITS.
I DREW THIS WITH MY LEFT HAND.

21:38.880 --> 21:39.840
Hey.

21:40.440 --> 21:42.520
I think your artwork is amazing, Mew.

21:42.600 --> 21:45.360
Your artwork to me feels very advanced.

21:45.440 --> 21:48.840
Some of them reminded me of artists
like Jackson Pollock, yeah.

21:50.400 --> 21:52.200
I've been admiring your artwork lately.

21:53.160 --> 21:55.000
I really think your work is genius.

21:55.080 --> 21:56.560
Beautiful trees are in the forest.

21:57.040 --> 21:59.160
The wide sky is full of bright stars.

21:59.240 --> 22:00.720
The star of art is you.

22:01.280 --> 22:03.080
The art circles can be developed further.

22:03.720 --> 22:06.920
Yeah, of course, there should be
something interesting for people to see.

22:08.120 --> 22:09.200
[Mew] An artist?

22:09.280 --> 22:10.120
MEW, THE ART GENIUS

22:10.200 --> 22:12.000
I'm not sure about that quite yet.

22:12.680 --> 22:15.440
As the great Surrealist painter,

22:15.520 --> 22:22.360
Salvador Dalí once said, "A true artist
isn't someone who needs inspiration,

22:22.440 --> 22:25.920
but someone who inspires other people."

22:26.920 --> 22:27.800
So…

22:28.280 --> 22:32.920
I'm not sure if I can call myself
an artist just yet.

22:33.000 --> 22:37.120
But if there are people
who started to draw

22:37.200 --> 22:40.720
and create works of art because of me,
then yeah,

22:40.800 --> 22:43.280
I think that's when
I can call myself an artist.

22:43.760 --> 22:44.960
[Plearn laughs]

22:45.040 --> 22:46.520
As I said before,

22:46.600 --> 22:49.720
"Even in darkness,
real diamonds will shine."

22:49.800 --> 22:50.680
[laughs]

22:51.240 --> 22:52.160
Yes.

22:52.640 --> 22:53.600
Yes.

22:54.160 --> 22:56.440
[bell tolls]

23:15.800 --> 23:18.840
That's right. Our school will organize
an open house event

23:18.920 --> 23:22.120
to showcase the works
of our genius students.

23:24.280 --> 23:27.280
The principal has scheduled
the event for next week

23:27.360 --> 23:30.720
and we would like to ask
all the geniuses in all subjects

23:30.800 --> 23:32.560
to prepare for this open house.

23:33.160 --> 23:36.440
Mew, I'm very proud of you

23:36.520 --> 23:40.520
for winning the first prize
from Siam Arts.

23:41.200 --> 23:44.560
I'll let you display
and present your work onstage.

23:45.880 --> 23:49.280
Why are we just showing
what we have already done?

23:49.760 --> 23:51.480
Won't that be way too boring?

23:53.240 --> 23:55.000
[Plearn] That's what I thought, too.

23:56.040 --> 23:57.080
Mew…

23:58.240 --> 24:00.560
should create a piece of art onstage.

24:02.800 --> 24:03.800
Well…

24:04.440 --> 24:05.600
Miss Plearn,

24:07.160 --> 24:09.840
I don't think anyone
would want to watch that.

24:10.800 --> 24:11.960
[student 1] I want to see it.

24:12.040 --> 24:13.720
[student 2] Yeah, I want to see it, too.

24:15.160 --> 24:16.880
-[students] Me, too.
-[laughter]

24:17.560 --> 24:18.960
[Plearn] Everyone wants to see it.

24:19.040 --> 24:21.120
If we advertise it like this,

24:21.200 --> 24:23.160
everyone will want to come and watch.

24:24.120 --> 24:27.000
I'll make sure to invite the judges
from Siam Arts,

24:27.080 --> 24:29.760
reporters, students from other schools,

24:30.240 --> 24:32.480
and the institute that ranks schools.

24:33.080 --> 24:34.280
When they see you,

24:34.360 --> 24:37.040
we might win for the second time in a row.

24:37.120 --> 24:38.360
[sighs]

24:39.680 --> 24:42.560
I think we should broadcast it live, too.

24:49.040 --> 24:53.440
Great idea. Let's do a live broadcast
through our Facebook page

24:53.520 --> 24:55.560
so that the whole world can watch.

24:56.080 --> 24:57.200
Oh, my god, Mew.

24:57.280 --> 24:59.720
You'll become famous
around the entire globe.

25:00.280 --> 25:04.960
[applauding]

25:12.760 --> 25:15.600
[foreboding music]

25:21.920 --> 25:22.960
Nanno!

25:24.360 --> 25:25.200
Hey.

25:25.760 --> 25:26.920
Why did you do that?

25:27.520 --> 25:28.720
You know that I…

25:28.800 --> 25:30.040
What are you scared of?

25:30.600 --> 25:32.200
You're a true genius now.

25:33.440 --> 25:35.080
That's fucking bullshit.

25:35.920 --> 25:37.400
You did that on purpose.

25:37.880 --> 25:39.240
What did I do wrong?

25:40.880 --> 25:41.960
You don't know?

25:42.040 --> 25:42.960
You…

25:45.720 --> 25:47.040
Why are you messing with me?

25:47.520 --> 25:49.360
Why aren't you messing with Pui?

25:49.920 --> 25:52.800
Mew, I didn't get you in trouble.

25:53.560 --> 25:56.400
Weren't you the one
who wanted to be a genius

25:56.480 --> 25:57.880
and become famous?

25:58.920 --> 26:00.240
I just helped you along.

26:00.760 --> 26:01.920
What did I do wrong?

26:03.880 --> 26:05.800
-You--
-Don't blame me. Blame yourself.

26:05.880 --> 26:06.800
[chuckles]

26:08.400 --> 26:10.800
Do you fucking realize
what you've done to me?

26:11.760 --> 26:14.160
Mew, best of luck to you.

26:16.200 --> 26:17.280
[grunts]

26:18.960 --> 26:20.160
Fuck!

26:21.400 --> 26:22.560
[sighs]

26:49.040 --> 26:51.120
[foreboding music]

27:01.800 --> 27:04.680
[paper rustling]

27:09.560 --> 27:11.280
[tense breathing]

27:13.920 --> 27:15.080
Mew, I brought you some food.

27:15.160 --> 27:16.120
Go away!

27:21.120 --> 27:23.440
[scribbles]

27:25.760 --> 27:28.440
[frustrated cry]

27:29.680 --> 27:32.720
[grunting, panting]

27:37.200 --> 27:38.440
[Nanno] Hello, Mew.

27:38.520 --> 27:40.760
I'm sorry if I'm interrupting
your workflow.

27:42.360 --> 27:45.120
Hey, did you see that post on Facebook?

27:46.680 --> 27:49.080
Someone said that you copied
their friend's artwork,

27:49.560 --> 27:51.360
but I'm not sure
what happened to the post.

27:52.440 --> 27:53.720
You crazy bitch.

27:54.560 --> 27:56.160
[Nanno] Hey! Mew…

27:56.720 --> 27:58.800
Don't be mean to me.

27:58.880 --> 28:00.640
I'm your biggest fan at school.

28:01.200 --> 28:03.600
I'll be waiting
for your next piece, genius.

28:06.360 --> 28:07.960
You'll be waiting for it?

28:08.840 --> 28:10.000
Right.

28:22.920 --> 28:23.960
Pui.

28:24.440 --> 28:26.320
I need your help. Can we talk?

28:28.480 --> 28:30.480
[foreboding music]

28:41.440 --> 28:44.760
Can we pretty please be friends again?
Please?

28:46.840 --> 28:47.960
Pretty please?

28:58.000 --> 28:58.960
[Mew] Pui.

29:00.360 --> 29:02.040
[Pui] You're not mad at me anymore?

29:03.600 --> 29:05.720
-Hmm.
-[chuckles]

29:07.600 --> 29:09.440
I wasn't actually mad at you.

29:11.720 --> 29:12.960
I was jealous of you.

29:14.840 --> 29:16.320
I was jealous…

29:19.520 --> 29:21.920
because you become a genius.

29:22.800 --> 29:25.600
I was jealous because everyone thought
you are special now.

29:28.280 --> 29:30.200
And I was still just me.

29:33.880 --> 29:36.760
Hey, that was a long, long time ago.

29:36.840 --> 29:39.280
Can we please, please be friends again?
Come on.

29:41.120 --> 29:43.560
[sighs]
Yeah.

29:45.120 --> 29:46.520
But I need your help with something.

29:47.480 --> 29:49.400
Sure. What would you like me to do?

29:52.480 --> 29:54.120
[Mew breathing heavily]

29:56.880 --> 29:58.400
I want you to hit me with this.

30:03.520 --> 30:06.240
Hey, that's not very funny.

30:08.000 --> 30:09.440
I can't do it.

30:10.360 --> 30:11.880
I can't go onstage.

30:11.960 --> 30:13.800
I stole other people's work.

30:15.320 --> 30:16.720
[Mew] Please help me.

30:17.760 --> 30:18.840
Please hit me!

30:18.920 --> 30:20.840
Hit me! Hit me!

30:20.920 --> 30:23.600
-Mew, calm down.
-[Mew] No, hit me!

30:23.680 --> 30:25.040
Hit me. Come on!

30:25.680 --> 30:28.520
Hit me. You said you would help me.
Just do it.

30:28.600 --> 30:31.280
What are you talking about?
This is not what I promised you.

30:31.360 --> 30:32.720
Come on, please.

30:32.800 --> 30:36.160
I've always been a good friend to you.
You can't just do this for me?

30:36.240 --> 30:37.400
Help me. Hit me!

30:37.480 --> 30:38.600
Hit me!

30:38.680 --> 30:39.920
-Just hit me!
-[Pui] I can't.

30:40.000 --> 30:41.360
Hit me already?

30:42.080 --> 30:44.920
[dramatic music]

30:45.000 --> 30:51.960
[inaudible dialogue]

30:52.440 --> 30:54.720
[dramatic music]

30:54.800 --> 30:57.320
[inaudible dialogue]

30:57.400 --> 30:59.960
Why won't you help me with this?
[cries]

31:00.040 --> 31:02.760
I've never asked you for anything, Pui.

31:03.280 --> 31:04.600
Hit me.

31:04.680 --> 31:05.920
Just hit me.

31:06.000 --> 31:07.040
Hit me!

31:08.120 --> 31:10.520
[sobs]

31:13.200 --> 31:14.760
You're not going to hit me?

31:15.640 --> 31:16.840
Okay, fine.

31:18.120 --> 31:19.880
[Mew groans]

31:21.160 --> 31:22.320
[cries]

31:23.480 --> 31:25.280
-[thumps]
-[pained scream]

31:27.240 --> 31:29.080
[Pui] Mew! Hey, Mew!

31:29.160 --> 31:31.080
-[Mew sobs]
-Stop it!

31:31.960 --> 31:34.280
[shrieks, wails]

31:34.360 --> 31:36.280
[Pui] Mew, what the fuck
is wrong with you?

31:36.360 --> 31:38.040
[Mew sobbing]

31:38.120 --> 31:39.960
[Pui] What the fuck is wrong with you?

31:41.200 --> 31:44.320
Mew. Come on. Come on.

31:44.400 --> 31:46.280
[Mew] What the fuck is wrong with you?

31:47.320 --> 31:49.120
Why did you do this to me?

31:54.880 --> 31:56.440
You were the one who hit me.

31:58.040 --> 31:59.560
Why did you hit me?

32:00.040 --> 32:02.640
-[Pui] Hey, I didn't do anything.
-[Mew] You hit me.

32:04.640 --> 32:06.200
I didn't do it at all.

32:07.520 --> 32:09.560
You were the one who hit me.

32:10.280 --> 32:11.400
[sniffles]

32:11.480 --> 32:13.040
Why did you hit me?

32:14.160 --> 32:18.440
[Mew sobbing]

32:18.520 --> 32:19.560
[Pui] Mew.

32:20.640 --> 32:23.000
-[Mew] Help me!
-[Pui] Mew.

32:23.560 --> 32:25.040
It hurts!

32:25.560 --> 32:27.280
-It hurts!
-[Plearn] What happened?

32:27.880 --> 32:29.480
[wailing]

32:29.560 --> 32:30.880
[Mew] Help me!

32:30.960 --> 32:32.960
-Mew!
-Mew! Oh, my god!

32:33.040 --> 32:34.920
-Mew!
-[student 1] Oh, my god. What is this?

32:35.000 --> 32:36.160
[student 2] What happened?

32:36.240 --> 32:38.200
-Pui did this to me.
-[Plearn] Why did you do this?

32:38.800 --> 32:41.200
What were you thinking? You hurt her.

32:41.280 --> 32:44.240
-Why did you do this, Pui? Why?
-I feel sorry for you, Mew.

32:44.320 --> 32:46.440
-[Mew] Why did you do this to me?
-[student 2] Mew.

32:47.960 --> 32:49.960
[sobs]
[Mew] It hurts.

32:51.520 --> 32:53.160
[Plearn] Are you okay?

32:53.760 --> 32:55.760
[dramatic music]

33:01.920 --> 33:03.520
[hammer clanks]

33:07.680 --> 33:11.120
[inaudible laugh]

33:19.280 --> 33:20.280
[Mew's mom sighs]

33:20.880 --> 33:22.480
[Mew's mom] What a shame.

33:23.240 --> 33:26.680
I wanted to see you create
a piece of art onstage.

33:27.480 --> 33:29.000
But then this happened.

33:30.040 --> 33:32.480
Now I have to sit here
and treat your wound instead.

33:35.520 --> 33:38.480
Your dad was going to close the shop
to watch you.

33:39.560 --> 33:43.080
He also invited your grandma
and all your aunties.

33:44.400 --> 33:46.800
Luckily, I stopped them in time,

33:46.880 --> 33:48.880
or they might have come for nothing.

33:50.640 --> 33:53.000
Yeah, I feel really bad about that, too.

33:55.000 --> 33:55.840
Mm.

34:00.000 --> 34:01.720
[Mew's mom] By the way, what happened?

34:02.600 --> 34:05.480
How did you and Pui end up
fighting with each other?

34:06.680 --> 34:09.480
You've been friends
since childhood, right?

34:09.960 --> 34:11.320
[doorbell rings]

34:14.840 --> 34:16.199
Stay here. I'll get it.

34:21.880 --> 34:24.600
-[Mew's mom] Oh, Hello, ma'am.
-[Plearn] Hi.

34:25.199 --> 34:26.760
[Mew's mom] Please come in.

34:26.840 --> 34:29.639
Mew, your teacher and friends
came to see you.

34:35.280 --> 34:36.800
Is your hand getting better?

34:38.600 --> 34:39.760
No, not yet.

34:40.920 --> 34:42.000
[Plearn] Don't worry.

34:42.080 --> 34:45.639
The school punished Pui
by not letting her display her work.

34:45.719 --> 34:48.920
If she hadn't won her writing award,
we would have expelled her.

34:51.639 --> 34:53.880
Pui was so violent towards you.

34:53.960 --> 34:56.280
Who knew that she could be so angry.

34:58.040 --> 34:59.160
[Plearn] How are you?

34:59.680 --> 35:01.600
Can you move your fingers a little bit?

35:01.680 --> 35:02.920
Can you try?

35:03.960 --> 35:05.960
You might still be able to go onstage.

35:10.400 --> 35:11.400
Ow!

35:12.800 --> 35:14.520
I can't, I'm sorry.

35:16.080 --> 35:19.240
But didn't you already go
to see the doctor?

35:21.200 --> 35:24.320
Yeah, but I still can't work
with my arm like this.

35:26.320 --> 35:28.400
[Plearn] Our school's open house will be…

35:29.880 --> 35:31.280
just a disaster.

35:36.920 --> 35:40.520
Hmm… Do you remember
what the principal always says, Mew?

35:41.640 --> 35:45.440
"Even in darkness,
real diamonds will shine."

35:46.800 --> 35:49.720
If I were you, I'd still go onstage.

35:50.440 --> 35:52.720
You can't let the school lose
its reputation.

35:52.800 --> 35:55.520
But if I go on stage and don't do well,

35:56.160 --> 35:58.120
I'll ruin the school's reputation
even more.

36:04.040 --> 36:06.240
But you can still use
your left arm, can't you?

36:06.800 --> 36:08.680
You posted it on Instagram.

36:09.320 --> 36:10.160
[Plearn] Right?

36:13.240 --> 36:15.440
Here. Let me find it.

36:16.040 --> 36:17.200
Just a sec.

36:22.520 --> 36:24.840
I DREW THIS WITH MY LEFT HAND.

36:24.920 --> 36:28.760
[chuckles]
That means, you can go on stage then.

36:31.000 --> 36:32.520
[Nanno] Congrats, Mew.

36:32.600 --> 36:34.880
You can share your special skills
with the world.

36:49.240 --> 36:51.120
[tranquil music]

36:51.200 --> 36:53.800
[applause]

36:58.840 --> 37:02.080
[light romantic music]

37:21.040 --> 37:22.960
Silence from all of humanity.

37:23.040 --> 37:25.120
The leaves drift and the birds sing.

37:25.200 --> 37:27.040
We hear the sound of corruption.

37:27.120 --> 37:28.280
Thank you.

37:29.040 --> 37:31.600
[audience applauding]

37:40.560 --> 37:42.880
[inaudible dialogue]

37:56.080 --> 37:57.440
Thank you, everyone

37:58.120 --> 37:59.600
for all your patience.

38:00.760 --> 38:03.600
We've now arrived
at the special moment in time

38:04.560 --> 38:06.200
that you've all been waiting for.

38:06.720 --> 38:09.200
It's time for the spotlight to shine

38:09.720 --> 38:13.160
on a Michelangelo and Picasso
of Lerdvithi School.

38:14.440 --> 38:17.080
She's our much-celebrated artist,

38:17.800 --> 38:19.360
a true original,

38:19.440 --> 38:23.880
please welcome
my friend and fellow genius, Mew.

38:23.960 --> 38:26.360
[applauding]

38:26.920 --> 38:28.480
-Please, I don't--
-Are you ready?

38:29.000 --> 38:30.160
I know you are.

38:30.960 --> 38:32.440
You have to go on stage right now.

38:33.800 --> 38:35.200
-I believe in you.
-[sobbing]

38:35.880 --> 38:36.880
Mew.

38:36.960 --> 38:38.840
-[Mew] I can't.
-Mew.

38:40.080 --> 38:42.240
You are my genius. You hear me?

38:42.920 --> 38:44.080
[sobs]

38:44.160 --> 38:48.400
[Nanno] Mew is considered
a true master of her craft

38:49.560 --> 38:53.880
because she can create
amazing masterpieces…

38:55.000 --> 38:57.200
in just a short period of time.

38:57.280 --> 38:58.400
And even though…

38:59.840 --> 39:02.160
she was in a terrible accident,

39:02.240 --> 39:04.640
that didn't stop her
from performing for us.

39:05.440 --> 39:06.320
Today,

39:06.880 --> 39:11.920
everyone will experience
how Mew creates her art.

39:13.760 --> 39:15.680
Everyone, please prepare your phones.

39:16.200 --> 39:18.040
We will be doing a live stream.

39:18.720 --> 39:22.480
Get ready for the whole world
to witness together

39:23.320 --> 39:26.320
this art genius, a living legend.

39:26.400 --> 39:28.600
[applause]

39:30.920 --> 39:32.960
[somber music]

39:33.040 --> 39:34.240
[applause continues]

39:35.640 --> 39:37.640
[foreboding music]

39:41.440 --> 39:44.120
[whimpers]

39:48.200 --> 39:51.360
[inaudible dialogue]

39:52.600 --> 39:54.440
[Nanno] Mew, you go!

39:54.520 --> 39:59.320
[audience] Mew, you go!
Mew, you go! Mew, you go!

39:59.400 --> 40:04.440
-Mew, you go! Mew, you go! Mew, you go!
-[cheering]

40:04.520 --> 40:07.920
Mew, you go! Mew, you go!

40:08.000 --> 40:14.120
Mew, you go! Mew, you go!
Mew, you go! Mew, you go!

40:14.200 --> 40:17.720
Mew, you go! Mew, you go!

40:17.800 --> 40:22.080
Mew, you go! Mew, you go! Mew, you go!

40:22.160 --> 40:24.120
-[DWY student] You thief!
-[audience] Mew, you, go!

40:24.640 --> 40:26.480
You stole my Indonesian friend's artwork!

40:26.560 --> 40:27.800
[principal] That's complete nonsense!

40:28.480 --> 40:29.800
It's not nonsense.

40:29.880 --> 40:32.080
She really stole my friend's work.

40:32.640 --> 40:33.840
Here. Take a look.

40:34.520 --> 40:38.440
The artwork you all praised
and said, "Wow, it's very good."

40:38.520 --> 40:40.080
She just stole someone else's artwork

40:40.160 --> 40:42.080
and splashed a bunch
of colors all over it.

40:42.160 --> 40:43.440
-Isn't that true?
-[Mew sobs]

40:44.920 --> 40:45.880
[Mew] I didn't--

40:45.960 --> 40:48.640
[DWY student] The evidence is right
in front of your eyes. Tell them.

40:48.720 --> 40:51.160
Tell them you think this school is stupid.

40:51.760 --> 40:55.200
The Siam Arts Association is also
stupid enough to get fooled by you.

40:55.880 --> 40:57.120
Look at it carefully.

40:58.680 --> 40:59.880
You can lie to others,

40:59.960 --> 41:01.480
but you can't lie to yourself.

41:01.960 --> 41:03.360
[principal] Let me see that.

41:04.720 --> 41:06.040
[Mew sobbing]

41:08.800 --> 41:11.240
It doesn't look like Mew's artwork at all.

41:15.320 --> 41:17.040
Which school are you from anyway?

41:17.600 --> 41:19.440
[principal] "D-W-Y."

41:19.520 --> 41:20.800
DWY.

41:20.880 --> 41:22.280
Denwittaya.

41:22.360 --> 41:23.320
[principal] I see.

41:23.400 --> 41:27.560
It's the rival school
that always ends up in second place, huh?

41:28.080 --> 41:31.400
The school that continues
to follow our every move.

41:31.480 --> 41:34.200
Whether we go to the left or the right,

41:34.280 --> 41:37.000
your school follows our every step.

41:37.080 --> 41:39.080
[DWY student] This is nothing to do
with my school.

41:39.160 --> 41:40.960
[principal] Of course, it does.

41:41.560 --> 41:44.400
You want to destroy
our pristine reputation,

41:44.480 --> 41:46.760
and that's why
you're accusing our student.

41:49.200 --> 41:50.960
I'm telling the truth. I swear.

41:51.040 --> 41:53.480
[principal]
Are you really speaking the truth?

41:54.440 --> 41:57.320
Do tell us, just how well do you know art?

41:57.400 --> 41:59.760
-How could you dare accuse her?
-[scoffs]

42:00.960 --> 42:02.680
[Mew sobbing]

42:02.760 --> 42:03.880
Confess already.

42:03.960 --> 42:06.440
[sobbing quietly]

42:06.520 --> 42:08.880
[DWY student] If you don't confess,
draw us a picture instead.

42:08.960 --> 42:11.240
Create a piece of art just like this one.

42:11.320 --> 42:12.360
Come on. Do it!

42:12.440 --> 42:14.440
So they will see what is real
and what is fake.

42:15.280 --> 42:16.400
[principal] Do it, Mew.

42:16.960 --> 42:19.840
Do it so that she stops talking nonsense.
Come on!

42:20.920 --> 42:22.000
[Plearn] Do it, Mew.

42:22.080 --> 42:23.520
[sobbing quietly]

42:23.600 --> 42:24.760
[Plearn] Mew, come on.

42:24.840 --> 42:26.160
[whimpers]

42:26.680 --> 42:27.680
[Plearn] Do it.

42:28.440 --> 42:30.600
[Nanno] Do it. Do it.

42:30.680 --> 42:35.520
-[Nanno] Do it!
-[audience] Do it! Do it! Do it! Do it!

42:35.600 --> 42:40.800
Do it! Do it! Do it! Do it! Do it!

42:40.880 --> 42:46.160
-Do it! Do it! Do it! Do it! Do it!
-[cheers, claps]

42:46.240 --> 42:51.360
Do it! Do it! Do it! Do it! Do it!

42:51.440 --> 42:56.880
Do it! Do it! Do it! Do it! Do it!

42:56.960 --> 42:58.960
Do it! Do it…

43:01.040 --> 43:03.480
[suspenseful music]

43:06.560 --> 43:08.600
[sobbing quietly]

43:11.880 --> 43:13.920
[whimpering]

43:18.320 --> 43:21.760
[sobbing]

43:45.640 --> 43:48.240
[whimpering]

43:50.000 --> 43:52.760
You see this? It looks just…

43:53.400 --> 43:56.440
like the other beautiful painting
she drew.

43:57.000 --> 44:00.960
Believe me, this is the real genius.
[chuckles]

44:04.120 --> 44:05.440
Her artwork is gentle

44:06.280 --> 44:08.000
powerful yet subtle.

44:08.480 --> 44:10.040
The way art should be.

44:11.520 --> 44:14.560
In addition, let me be perfectly clear,

44:15.200 --> 44:20.440
it's impossible that Lerdvithi School
and Siam Arts Association would praise

44:20.520 --> 44:24.240
a fake artwork or a fake genius.
Never in a million years.

44:24.320 --> 44:26.760
[DWY student] Are you crazy?
They don't look the same at all!

44:27.400 --> 44:28.720
[principal] You are the crazy one.

44:28.800 --> 44:31.480
Why can't you see
that they have the exact same style.

44:31.560 --> 44:33.560
Why can't you see that Mew
is a true genius?

44:33.640 --> 44:35.680
Because she's not a genius
and they're not the same.

44:35.760 --> 44:36.760
-Come on!
-[Plearn] Stop!

44:36.840 --> 44:39.800
Stop slandering Mew,
or I'm gonna make sure

44:39.880 --> 44:41.400
to sue you and everyone at your school.

44:41.480 --> 44:43.400
I'm not slandering anyone.
I'm telling the truth.

44:43.480 --> 44:46.760
The ugly truth is,
you are from Denwittaya School,

44:46.840 --> 44:48.560
the forever-second-place school.

44:48.640 --> 44:50.800
You just want to discredit
Lerdvithi School

44:50.880 --> 44:53.320
and everyone at Siam Arts Association.

44:54.040 --> 44:55.120
Get out now.

44:55.200 --> 44:56.080
Guard.

44:57.880 --> 44:59.240
Stop it. I'm leaving.

44:59.320 --> 45:01.040
[audience booing]

45:01.120 --> 45:03.760
-[DWY student] Don't blame the messenger.
-[audience booing]

45:03.840 --> 45:05.880
-What are you booing at?
-[booing continues]

45:05.960 --> 45:08.720
You're all stupid!
You can't even tell what art is!

45:08.800 --> 45:10.000
[audience booing]

45:10.080 --> 45:11.520
[DWY student] What is wrong with you?

45:11.600 --> 45:15.240
The rudeness and lack of expertise
gave her away. What a sad school.

45:15.320 --> 45:17.320
-[chuckles]
-[student] Boo!

45:19.000 --> 45:22.040
You must be in a state of shock.

45:23.560 --> 45:24.760
Don't worry, my dear.

45:25.960 --> 45:27.760
She's just jealous of you.

45:29.200 --> 45:31.240
Listen. You are already a genius to me.

45:31.760 --> 45:34.800
No one can take that away from you now.

45:36.680 --> 45:39.360
I'm really proud of you, Mew, my dear. Hm?

45:39.440 --> 45:42.320
You are truly a role model
for everyone here,

45:42.800 --> 45:45.080
and a shining example of our geniuses.

45:45.160 --> 45:48.160
You are living up to the motto
of Lerdvithi School.

45:48.240 --> 45:51.160
"Even in darkness,
real diamonds will shine."

45:51.240 --> 45:52.720
[laughs loudly]

45:56.640 --> 45:57.520
Yes.

45:58.000 --> 45:59.880
Now that everything has settled down,

46:00.360 --> 46:03.040
why don't we just listen to Mew's speech?

46:03.600 --> 46:05.480
It might inspire us all today.

46:45.200 --> 46:46.840
"Thank you, everyone,

46:47.400 --> 46:49.200
for supporting me here today.

46:51.520 --> 46:52.920
Standing by me,

46:54.480 --> 46:56.200
and believing in who I am.

46:57.800 --> 47:00.640
[sniffles]
I really appreciate that.

47:02.400 --> 47:04.560
Everyone has gathered here today

47:05.720 --> 47:07.240
to fight for me.

47:09.120 --> 47:10.120
[sniffles]

47:10.200 --> 47:11.520
I believe that

47:12.240 --> 47:14.360
what we fought for today

47:16.080 --> 47:17.560
will be a good example.

47:19.360 --> 47:21.120
A good example…
[whimpers]

47:22.360 --> 47:24.080
It will be a good example

47:24.840 --> 47:26.200
for the society

47:27.480 --> 47:29.240
to learn about love and unity.

47:30.760 --> 47:32.240
This would make…

47:34.240 --> 47:39.120
our society stable in the future
to come under the leadership

47:41.600 --> 47:43.760
of the geniuses

47:44.880 --> 47:46.440
of Lerdvithi School.

47:48.640 --> 47:49.800
Finally,

47:51.080 --> 47:54.080
I would like to end this speech
with the motto of Lerdvithi School.

47:56.200 --> 47:57.520
'Even in darkness,

47:59.080 --> 48:00.440
real diamonds will shine.'"

48:01.880 --> 48:05.880
[applause]

48:07.160 --> 48:10.040
[audience cheering]

48:17.360 --> 48:19.520
[students whooping]

48:21.120 --> 48:24.280
[applause continues]

48:31.600 --> 48:34.760
[Nanno] I wish you happiness
in this world, Mew.

48:36.760 --> 48:39.080
[suspenseful music]

48:55.080 --> 48:56.200
[bell tolls]

48:56.840 --> 48:58.840
[closing theme music]
